"""The whole hair editor pipeline on real assets: apply, edit, convert to cards, bake, unbake and delete.

Everything here needs the hair editor asset pack and is skipped without it. The bakes run at 64x64 with a single
sample, which is enough to go through every step of the bake without taking long.
"""

